C#JavaKotlinTypeScript <pre><code>// Create an entry endpoint
var client = new EntryEndpoint(new Uri("http://example.com/api/"));

// Create child endpoint
var contacts = new CollectionEndpoint&lt;Contact&gt;(client, "contacts");
</code></pre> <pre><code>// Create an entry endpoint
EntryEndpoint client = new EntryEndpoint(URI.create("http://example.com/api/"));

// Create child endpoint
