await messages.create({ text: "Hello!" });

// Consume new messages
for await (const x of messages.stream()) {
    console.log(`New message: ${x.text}`);
}
</code></pre> <p>You can also use <code>GenericStreamingCollectionEndpoint</code> to use a custom type derived from <code>ElementEndpoint</code> for elements.</p> <pre><code>const messages = new GenericStreamingCollectionEndpoint&lt;Message, MessageEndpoint&gt;(client, "messages", MessageEndpoint);
</code></pre>

